  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Deload Week — Advanced Hypertrophy Block\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary recovery:\n    name \"Recover from high-volume hypertrophy block\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Upper Push - Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          scapular_retraction 2x10\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 2x8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 1m\n          shoulder_stretch 1m\n          tricep_stretch 1m\n      DAY Tuesday training 45m \"Lower - Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          leg_swings 1m\n          hip_circles 1m\n          glute_bridge 2x10\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 2x6 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 2x8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          leg_press 2x10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          standing_calf_raise 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 1m\n          hamstring_stretch 1m\n          hip_flexor_stretch 1m\n      DAY Thursday training 45m \"Upper Pull - Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          scapular_retraction 2x10\n          face_pull 2x12 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n        main straight_sets:\n          pull_up 2x6 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          barbell_row 2x8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          rear_delt_fly 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 1m\n          back_stretch 1m\n          spinal_twist 1m\n      DAY Saturday training 40m \"Full Body Light - Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5m\n          cat_cow 2x10\n          bird_dog 2x10\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 2x10 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_press 2x10 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 2x10 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          plank 3x45 rest 45 seconds\n          pallof_press 2x10 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          walking 5m\n          child_pose 1m\n          pigeon_pose 2x60",
